  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "C38DF125E6D2FF90",
      "text": "呃啊～！\\n遲到啦，遲到啦～！[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "7C6C59D62A6DB258",
      "text": "啊～！海岱！\\n請等等啊～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "7C6C5CD62A6DB771",
      "text": "唉～走掉了。\\n你有東西忘記帶走啊……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "7C6C5BD62A6DB5BE",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳該不會是要來道館的\\n挑戰者吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "D3677BC9BEA50865",
      "text": "是！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "D36778C9BEA5034C",
      "text": "呃……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_04a",
      "hash64": "D9DFDBEA18744342",
      "text": "果然！我就知道！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_04b",
      "hash64": "D9DFDAEA1874418F",
      "text": "雖然嘴上是這樣說，\\n但[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳一定是挑戰者啦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "7C6C5DD62A6DB924",
      "text": "剛才那個塊頭很大的叔叔是\\n玻瓶道館的館主海岱。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "7C6C60D62A6DBE3D",
      "text": "他這個人啊，有點淘氣，\\n明明是要去市場採購，\\r\\n卻忘了帶錢包呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "7C6C5FD62A6DBC8A",
      "text": "海岱他現在一定在傷腦筋……\\c\\n這位好心的挑戰者！\\n可以請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳把錢包送去給他嗎！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_08a",
      "hash64": "D9B6D3EA18513096",
      "text": "哎呀，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳真是個大好人！\\n讓我想現在就把道館徽章\\r\\n當場送[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳了呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_08b",
      "hash64": "D9B6D2EA18512EE3",
      "text": "很抱歉，但要是海岱他不在\\n就無法進行道館挑戰了，\\r\\n而且我又不能離開櫃台，所以……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_09",
      "hash64": "7C6C51D62A6DA4C0",
      "text": "來，這就交給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_10",
      "hash64": "7C6954D62A6B7402",
      "text": "這是特例，但只要[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳將它交給海岱，\\n我就會當作[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳通過了道館測驗！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_11",
      "hash64": "7C6955D62A6B75B5",
      "text": "海岱他往[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]漬沁鎮[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]去了，\\n那裡得穿過西邊的沙漠才能到達！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_12",
      "hash64": "7C6952D62A6B709C",
      "text": "沙漠有許多危險的寶可夢。\\n一路當心喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
